Changes in v2.8 2026-11-01:
– New key remember to use stored contents before storing them.
– New key getstored for \mergesc and new keys for \foreachsc.
– New programming interface for expl3.
– Unknown keys and package options raise an error.
– Check positive integers in start, step, stop and width-tab.
– Fix negative index in \typestored, \meaningsc and \mergesc.
– Fix \mergesc with undefined sequences and index out of range.
– Fix loading and file checks in ConTeXt and plain TeX.
– Add regression tests for LaTeX, plain TeX and ConTeXt.
– Update requirement to LaTeX release 2026-11-01.
